From 1dbdd551ae310d1b07e37658a479655889109383 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rasheed <arasheedu@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 23:32:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] llama: carry the deep trace tier in the visualizer
 patch

Regenerated llama/compat/100-visualizer-trace.patch (git diff b11963
visualizer-trace): adds trace.deep (decode.node, decode.lens,
decode.attn.heads) and llama_trace_logit_lens().

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
